WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Open a public WebHDP page for a published Zenodo 3D record.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Inspect metadata, file count, DOI, and preview controls.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Open the iframe-safe embed page for the same record.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:22.000
Verify the oEmbed endpoint returns a rich JSON iframe response.
